//
//  CornerIconArt.swift
//  Windfall
//
//  The snowdrop of the app icon, as outlines the corner drawing can use
//  in February.
//
//  The text in quotes is copied from the icon's own file (the project
//  file design/windfall-app-icon-light.svg, knowledge base doc 47). It
//  is path text: M means "move to", L "line to", C "curve to" and Z
//  "close the shape", each followed by positions on the icon's own
//  grid. CornerPaths.fromText turns it into a shape.
//
//  It is kept as three groups so each can move by itself: the stalk
//  leans, the leaves flutter and the flower swings from the stalk's tip.
//
//  The line widths are three quarters of the icon's, so the snowdrop
//  sits with the fine line of the other months.
//
//  If the icon is redrawn, copy its new outlines here.
//

